  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support GFSIS II - Core support GFSIS II (NEW STRATEGY)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d GFSIS II 2022-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">GFSIS &#xe4;r en ideell georgisk tankesmedja vars syfte &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra samh&#xe4;llsstyrning och introducera policybaserat beslutsfattande genom forskning och analys, utbildning av beslutsfattare och utbildningsinsatser inom regionala och internationella strategifr&#xe5;gor.
GFSIS arbetar med statstj&#xe4;nstem&#xe4;n, etniska och religi&#xf6;sa minoriteter, politiska partier, journalister och den georgiska ortodoxa kyrkan.

Insatsen &#xe4;r ett k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d. Verksamheten har tre huvudinriktningar: utbildning och kompetensutveckling, forskning och analys samt informations- och p&#xe5;verkansarbete. 

Verksamheten f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas leda till f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad samh&#xe4;llsstyrning och policybaserat beslutsfattande samt till att st&#xf6;dja konfliktprevention och en fredlig utveckling i regionen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Georgian Foundation for Strategic and International Studies (GFSIS) mission defined as not-for-profit think tank dedicated to improvement of good governance practises and introducing policy based decision making culture in Georgia through research and analyses, training of policy makers and policy analyses and public education about strategic issues - both domestic and international.
GFSIS works with public servants, ethnic and religious minorities and other parts of the society, like political parties, journalists, Georgian orthodox church.
The intervention is a core support to GFSIS. GFSIS work in three directions a) teaching and training, b) research and analysis and c) public outreach and awareness raising. The activities contribute to good governance practices and to introducing policy-based decision making culture. One of the objectives of the GFSIS is to support conflict prevention and peace building efforts in the region. Overall the contribution aims to contribute to common understanding of values and priorities that should guide Georgia towards its ambition towards European integration.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the intervention is to improve good governance practices and to introduce policy-based decision-making culture in Georgia.</narrative>
  </description>
